@1 = ~This is the place. The caravan is down this path. Red Fang Marauders jumped at us from behind the trees. Search the area, maybe you'll find out where they went. Once you find something, come back to me.~
@2 = ~Did you find anything?~
@3 = ~Yes. Here are your spices. We killed every member that dwelled in their cave, including a mysterious woman who seemed to be the leader.~
@4 = ~No. Still investigating.~
@5 = ~Amazing. You really did it. I can see that your reputation is well deserved. I will inform my co-workers to clean this mess up and collect what other supplies and stolen goods they find in the caves. Thank you so much for all your help. Shall we come back to Baldur's Gate?~
@6 = ~Yes. Let us go.~
@7 = ~Hold on. We want to take a look one last time.~
